        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AE-Z8, Elite Collection Ornate Lever with Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOrnate but not overly fancy, this Fusion Hardware made leverset is the perfect finishing touch to elegant spaces. The Ornate Leverset with Rope Rose is available in dummy, privacy, and passage functions. Choose from any of the 5 available finishes. The Ornate Lever with Rope Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Concealed screw mounting keeps this traditional lever and rose set looking beautiful once installed with no visible mounting screws as an eyesore.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AE-Z8 Ornate Leverset with Round Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion lever spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Ornate Scroll Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: The Single Dummy Function is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
